Song Saran, president of one of Cambodia's largest rice exporters, Amru Rice Cambodia, said the export plan proposed by the new company was not possible because Cambodian rice was difficult to compete on price with other countries. To import to China.
The prices of regular rice in Vietnam, Pakistan and Myanmar are all lower than in Cambodia for fragrant rice. Recently, Thailand has started to lower some prices, which is also affecting Cambodian rice orders.
