In her organization for seven years now, she has led 102 farmers to join a cooperative where they can save money and get loans to meet their family needs. Yes.
In addition, Chey Siyat constantly encourages women to learn more about social empowerment, leadership skills and other capacity building activities that help improve the lives of women farmers.
The organization formed two women's groups.
