We have a human resource development program, we have a technical cooperation program where many officials from new members of ASEAN come to Singapore to present our development, our work, how to work and take their ideas. Applicable when they return to their home country.
But a Cambodian economist differs on the prospects for improved regional economic integration, which allows for a free influx of labor, goods and services.
