Helping them run their small business is one of the main goals of our association.
Funding or providing direct subsidies to those in need is not the job of the AAC, but providing specific business and start-up skills is their main focus.
AAC is currently collaborating with more than 50 craft groups or NGOs that are members of the association.
AAC will then collaborate with its members to open a variety of training courses or workshops for those staff.
