We all know that they are just poor people who hope to earn a living on their own, and their status as a social enterprise can be far from attracting customers and can escape direct competition.
As he has already stated, social enterprise is a business not only for the purpose of making a profit, but to improve the lives of poor workers, increase their capacity and job confidence.
Cambodian handicraft workers can be successful and earn a lot of money.
